  {
    "section": "league_overview",
    "content": "Four official-tier strategies are active after ~57 hours of scheduled runtime. Cosmo & Wanda - Top 20 remains the incumbent champion with the deepest realized sample (64 trades, +$62.84) but carries significant unrealized drag (~-$61.79) that compresses net equity toward par. Timmy - Top 20 leads nominal equity (~$1,002.06) on minimal realized closure, leaving its performance effectively hostage to a single open mark. Both Top 50 variants are struggling: Timmy - Top 50 has booked realized losses (-$19.81) and below-par equity, while Cosmo & Wanda - Top 50 is accumulating unrealized bleed (~-$29.42) post-restart despite a 100% realized win rate. The central research axis is whether tighter Top 20 pair coverage preserves edge and whether champion exits outperform passive unrealized accumulation.",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-08T07:44:46.932426+00:00"
  },
  {
    "section": "ml_hypothesis_updates",
    "content": "[{\"id\": \"ghost-ladder\", \"status\": \"testing\", \"evidence_quality\": \"early\", \"next_action\": \"Executor must start ghost-ladder-clean-backtest-wfv1 on cross-exchange_ladder_samples_b immediately; define exact thresholds after separation analysis.\"}, {\"id\": \"dark-matter-antimatter\", \"status\": \"dry-run candidate\", \"evidence_quality\": \"low\", \"next_action\": \"Halt live capital expansion. Execute leakage-controlled revalidation on hyperliquid_futures_5m_regime_set_a with strict non-overlapping windows targeting AUC > 0.65.\"}]",
